04:36.480 --> 04:42.319
one, if I may, is a case where you have independent modules of your system and

04:42.319 --> 04:45.339
you've got an objective and you can see a way that different

04:45.339 --> 04:49.519
Claude codes could work independently. And indeed you could just spawn at

04:49.519 --> 04:50.459
multiple terminals and run Claude and have them run independently. And indeed, you could just spawn multiple terminals

